## Prisma

Prisma setup is scaffolded automatically in:

- `prisma/schema.prisma`
- `prisma/seed.ts`
- `src/lib/prisma.server.ts`
- `prisma.config.ts`
- `module.ts`
- `service.ts`
- `prisma-composer.config.ts`
- `src/generated/prisma`

Database helper scripts are added to `package.json`:

- `db:generate`
- `db:push`
- `db:migrate`
- `db:seed`
{{#if (eq schemaPreset "basic")}}

The home route uses a TanStack Start server function to load users with the Prisma client from `src/lib/prisma.server.ts`, so you can verify a real database query without adding an API route first.
{{/if}}
{{#if composer}}

## Prisma Composer

The application topology is declared in `module.ts` and `service.ts`, with deploy configuration in `prisma-composer.config.ts`. {{#if composerPostgres}}Composer provisions Prisma Postgres and injects its connection into the service.{{else}}The database URL is bound as a secret service input from `.env`.{{/if}}

Run `{{runScriptCommand packageManager "deploy"}}` to deploy later changes.
{{/if}}
